    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>A ResultSet is a list of `PageElement` objects, gathered as the result
of matching an :py:class:`ElementFilter` against a parse tree. Basically, a list of
search results.
</verbatim> </para>
